+## Quality gates
+
+The skills named below are installed globally in `~/.agents/skills`. If one is unavailable, still follow the intent of the gate.
+
+- **Before saying a change is done**, run `npm run lint`, `npx tsc --noEmit`, `node --test tests/*.test.mjs` (Node 22.18+) and `npm run build`, and report the actual output (`verification-before-completion`).
+- **Bugs and failing checks:** find and state the root cause before changing code (`systematic-debugging`).
+- **Before a PR or merge:** review the branch diff with `find-bugs` and `code-review`.
+- **Security-sensitive changes** also get `differential-review` or `security-review`: `proxy.ts`, sign-in and session or token handling, anything that forwards requests or headers to the FastAPI backend, rendering user-entered text such as notes and route names, and `NEXT_PUBLIC_` variables. Ownership is enforced by the backend; the UI hiding an action is never the protection.
+- **API contract changes:** check them with `api-and-interface-design` against the live OpenAPI schema before touching `lib/api.ts` or `lib/actions.ts`.
+- **New pure logic** in `lib/` (grades, journal summaries, filters) gets a `node:test` case in `tests/`; use `tdd` for anything non-trivial.
+- **New dependencies:** run `supply-chain-risk-auditor` before adding one.
